[h2]Build 0.9.141[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]When the industrial repair center turns gear away because no bill's filter allows it, the message (on the machine and on conveyor arms) now names the bill and the setting that blocks it, e.g. a material entry such as "Allow jute" that is unticked, the item itself, or the hit-point or quality range.
[/list]
